sentences.t:
Nē inc ǣnig mon,
nē lēof nē lāð, belēan mihte
sorhfullne sīð, þā git on sund reôn;

þǣr git ēagorstrēam earmum þehton,
mǣton merestrǣta, mundum brugdon,
glidon ofer gārsecg;

Mē tō grunde tēah
fāh fēondscaða, fæste hæfde
grim on grāpe;

hwæþre mē gyfeþe wearð,
þæt ic āglǣcan orde gerǣhte,
hildebille;
